<Slide style={{
    width: '1280px',
    height: '720px',
    position: 'relative',
    background: '#F7F3EA',
    padding: 0,
    fontFamily: '"PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, left: 0,
        width: '300px', height: '720px',
        background: '#0B3D2E',
        padding: '68px 36px 54px 72px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
        justifyContent: 'space-between',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 3, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 15,
                color: '#F0A050',
                letterSpacing: 3,
                fontWeight: 600,
            }}>
                RHYTHM
            </Text>
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 40,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#F7F3EA',
                lineHeight: 1.34,
                letterSpacing: 3,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                主持
                <br />
                節奏
            </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 60, height: 2, background: 'rgba(240,160,80,.5)' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: 'rgba(247,243,234,.62)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                對工程師，���快」是精簡；對業務團隊，「快」是熱絡；對長輩，「快」是從容。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{
        position: 'absolute',
        top: 0, right: 0,
        width: '980px', height: '720px',
        padding: '58px 68px 50px 44px',
        flexDirection: 'column',
    }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'center', height: 62 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 34, background: '#C75B12' }} />
            <Text style={{
                fontSize: 33,
                fontWeight: 'bold',
                color: '#0B3D2E',
                letterSpacing: 1,
                fontFamily: 'Georgia, "Songti SC", "STSong", serif',
            }}>
                開場快、內容穩、轉場快、高潮慢、結尾快而有力
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: 0, minHeight: 0, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 11, paddingTop: 12 }}>
            {[
                { w: 212, k: '開場　快', d: '決定一場會生死的是頭十五分鐘。開場只需三句話：討論什麼、聚焦哪三個重點；希望產出什麼結論；時間如何分配。' },
                { w: 330, k: '內容　穩', d: '報告與數據一旦出錯，全場都會停下來重新對齊。此時主持人不該急著推進，而該把節奏交給內容本身。' },
                { w: 248, k: '轉場　快', d: '議題與議題之間的縫隙最容易失控。一句「這個議題我們待會另約時間談，先把目前這個收斂」就能把跑掉的話題拉回來。' },
                { w: 372, k: '高潮　慢', d: '越是需要決策的議題，越要慢。催著舉手只會讓人選擇沉默；把時間讓給分歧，讓不同的聲音把話說完。' },
                { w: 290, k: '結尾　快而有力', d: '最後十分鐘不能水。必須當場把「誰、做什麼、何時完成」念出來、當場確認，讓每個人帶走一份屬於自己的任務。' },
            ].map((item, idx) => (
                <Box key={item.k} style={{
                    height: 88,
                    flexShrink: 0,
                    flexDirection: 'row',
                    gap: 18,
                    alignItems: 'stretch',
                    background: '#FFFFFF',
                    borderRadius: 6,
                    padding: 0,
                    boxShadow: '0 4px 18px rgba(11,61,46,.07)',
                    overflow: 'hidden',
                }}>
                    <Box style={{
                        width: item.w,
                        flexShrink: 0,
                        background: idx === 3 ? '#C75B12' : 'rgba(11,61,46,.10)',
                        justifyContent: 'center',
                        alignItems: 'center',
                        paddingLeft: 14,
                        paddingRight: 14,
                    }}>
                        <Text style={{
                            fontSize: 17,
                            fontWeight: 600,
                            color: idx === 3 ? '#F7F3EA' : '#0B3D2E',
                            letterSpacing: 1,
                        }}>
                            {item.k}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1, minWidth: 0, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', padding: '12px 20px 12px 4px', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#5C5850', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                            {item.d}
                        </Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            ))}
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8578', letterSpacing: 1 }}>高效會議主持 SOP</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8A8578', letterSpacing: 1 }}>08 / 14</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>
</Slide>
